                    \\\
                    \\downarrow &amp;&amp; \downarrow &amp;&amp; \downarrow
                    \\\
                    * &amp;\stackrel{S}{\to}&amp; \mathbf{H}(X, \mathbf{B} Spin(n))
                    \&amp;\stackrel{\frac{1}{2}\mathbf{p}_1}{\to}&amp;
