                      %mo ,
                      %mi ℤ
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} H^3(P, \mathbb{Z})
                of this bundle gerbe, represented by
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi P
                      %mo →
